        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Coco Gauff is living her dream. On September 10, 2023, the 19-year-old tennis player from Florida won the US Open. She is the first American teenager to win this big tennis game since Serena Williams did it in 1999."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Many famous people came to watch her play. They all cheered when she won. Even Barack Obama, a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "former",
            "ref": "v-former"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " US President, said he was proud of her. “We know you will do even greater things in the future,” he wrote on Instagram."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Gauff first became famous in 2019. At just 15 years old, she played at "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Wimbledon",
            "zh": "温布尔登网球锦标赛"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It was her first Grand Slam "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "debut",
            "ref": "v-debut"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", and she did very well, reaching the fourth "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "round",
            "ref": "v-round"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". In 2022, she was the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "runner-up",
            "zh": "亚军"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " at the French Open."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Gauff always looked up to Serena and Venus Williams as her "
          },
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "idols"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". “When I was growing up, they showed me that my tennis dream was possible,” she said. “Winning a Grand Slam title was always my biggest dream since I started playing.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "Now that",
            "ref": "v-now-that"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " her childhood dream has come true, what will she do next? “I want to keep winning more "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "tournaments",
            "ref": "v-tournament"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ",” said the happy young "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "champion",
            "ref": "v-champion"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". “That will be my new goal.”"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
